          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li#UFP13
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Univalent+Foundations+Project"}> Univalent Foundations Project
                , §1.7 and §A.28 in:
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Homotopy+Type+Theory+--+Univalent+Foundations+of+Mathematics"} Homotopy Type Theory – Univalent Foundations of Mathematics
                (2013) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://homotopytypetheory.org/book/"}> web
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://hottheory.files.wordpress.com/2013/03/hott-online-323-g28e4374.pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Egbert+Rijke"}> Egbert Rijke
                , Def. 3.2.1 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Inductive types and the universe
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/erijke/hott/"} Introduction to Homotopy Type Theory 2018
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/erijke/hott/inductive.pdf"}> pdf
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p The definition of the empty type from the type of propositions and dependent product types can be found in:
          %ul
            %li
              Madeleine Birchfield,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Constructing coproduct types and boolean types from universes
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://mathoverflow.net/questions/457904/constructing-coproduct-types-and-boolean-types-from-universes"} web
          %p
            In
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Agda"} Agda
          %ul
