              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mart%C3%ADn+H%C3%B6tzel+Escard%C3%B3"}> Martín Hötzel Escardó
              ,
              %a{:href => "https://www.cs.bham.ac.uk/~mhe/HoTT-UF-in-Agda-Lecture-Notes/HoTT-UF-Agda.html#emptytype"} §2.6
